SUMMARY:Wines &amp; Sunsets at Paradise with Jared Nels
DESCRIPTION:Wines &amp; Sunsets returns to Paradise Ridge Winery with a lively Wednesday night concert series set against stunning vineyard views. Beginning May 6\, guests can enjoy a rotating lineup of live music and local food vendors in a relaxed\, open-air setting.    Kick off the season with live performances by Jared Nels and Austin Skalecki\, paired with delicious bites from Drip Sandwiches. Sip your favorite wines while soaking in the sunset and enjoying great music with friends and community.    Doors open at 5:15 PM—come early\, grab your spot\, and settle in for an unforgettable evening in Paradise.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/wines-sunsets-at-paradise-with-jared-nels/
