SUMMARY:Blockprint Workshop at Marietta Cellar's Tasting Room
DESCRIPTION:Join us in the beautiful Marietta Tasting Room for a special hands-on block printing workshop. Naomi will guide attendees through the timeless craft of block printing—an ancient relief technique where hand-carved designs are inked and pressed to create one-of-a-kind prints on fabric or paper.Spend a creative evening designing and printing bespoke pieces—perhaps a set of napkins\, a table runner\, or a festive tea towel—to bring art and intention to your table. Enjoy slowing down\, connecting\, and leaning into your creative process\, and take home your handmade creation as a keepsake.We will have items available for printing\, or you can bring something from home you would like to adorn or create a pattern on. Come with a design idea and leave with your own rubber stamp to create with after the class. Light snacks and the first pour of wine are included.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/blockprint-workshop-at-marietta-cellars-tasting-room/
LOCATION:250 Center St., Healdsburg, CA, 95448
CATEGORIES:Arts,Crafts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/08070605/blockprint-workshop.jpg
END:VEVENT
