SUMMARY:Hayde Bluegrass Orchestra at Brannan Center
DESCRIPTION:Experience the Hayde Bluegrass Orchestra at Brannan Center\, Norway’s breakout bluegrass sensation. This eight-piece ensemble blends Appalachian roots with Celtic and Norwegian fiddle influences\, delivering high-energy originals and heartfelt ballads. Hailed internationally for their virtuosity and rich vocals\, they’ve earned IBMA Momentum Awards\, a Norwegian Grammy nomination for Migrants\, and millions of streams worldwide. Inspired by the film The Broken Circle Breakdown\, the band has grown into a global phenomenon\, praised as “the impossible dream of what Norwegian musicians can achieve” by Puls Music Magazine. Don’t miss this chance to see one of modern bluegrass’s most thrilling acts live\, combining soaring harmonies\, driving rhythms\, and unforgettable performances that captivate audiences across the globe.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/hayde-bluegrass-orchestra-at-brannan-center/
LOCATION:1407 Third Street , Calistoga, CA, 94574, United States
CATEGORIES:Live Music,Music,Performing Arts,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/03230109/IMG_6269.jpg
END:VEVENT
