SUMMARY:Convene + Caviar | Apéro Hour
DESCRIPTION:Guests are invited to enjoy a relaxed apéro hour inspired by the French tradition of unwinding with wine and light bites. Drawing from Dan Kosta’s early restaurant experience\, this gathering offers a refined yet easygoing atmosphere.    Attendees can taste newly released spring wines alongside Dan\, complemented by Tsar Nicoulai caviar for an indulgent pairing.    This elegant experience provides a perfect introduction to Mother’s Day weekend\, blending flavor\, conversation\, and a touch of French-inspired charm.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/convene-caviar-apero-hour-at-convene-by-dan-kosta/
