SUMMARY:Waldorf Springtime Soiree at Frey
DESCRIPTION:Join the Waldorf School of Mendocino County for a lively evening of music\, dancing\, and community at this benefit event. Enjoy a performance by Mama Grows Funk\, along with delicious food\, local wines\, and a festive atmosphere.    Guests can take part in a silent auction and the exciting Super Raffle drawing\, all while supporting the school’s programs. With a sliding scale admission\, this 21+ event offers a fun and meaningful way to give back while celebrating the season.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/waldorf-springtime-soiree-at-frey/
